usage: harness ledger [-h] {verify,report,tail,defer-stats,repair} ...

positional arguments:
  {verify,report,tail,defer-stats,repair}
    tail                show the last N ledger entries (default 20)
    defer-stats         aggregate WHY runs deferred (panel defer rate, mid-
                        task categories, consent outcomes)
    repair              truncate the ledger to its longest valid hash-chain
                        prefix (drops forked/duplicate tail)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
